  "body": "Five bedrooms. Four and a half bathrooms. Three schools minutes away. Two master suites. One brand-new home.\r\n\r\nAll agents' buyers are welcomed. Contact Wayne and Emma for conjunction.\r\n\r\nIf you're a family of three, this probably isn't for you. If you've got growing kids, visiting parents, or both, keep reading.\r\n\r\nThis brand-new standalone home is finished and certified. The Code Compliance Certificate was issued in August 2026, it's covered by a 10-year Master Build warranty, and it sits on its own freehold title. Nothing to fix. Nothing to guess. Nothing to renovate.\r\n\r\nRoom for everyone, without the queue\r\n*  Ground floor: a bedroom with its own bathroom and wardrobe, ready for grandparents, guests or a live-in relative\r\n*  Upstairs: two master suites, each with an ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, plus two more bedrooms and a family bathroom\r\n*  Five toilets across four bathrooms and a guest powder room. Nobody waits.\r\n*  Open kitchen and dining for big family dinners, plus a separate laundry\r\n*  Internal access garage: a flexible space for a gym, rumpus or home office\r\n*  Approx. 182 m² of floor area (non-verified) on approx. 227 m² of freehold land\r\n\r\nThe school run, sorted\r\nMinutes to Macleans Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College. Pigeon Mountain is on your doorstep, with Half Moon Bay Marina, the ferry and Highland Park shopping a short drive away.\r\nBuyers should confirm school zoning with each school.\r\n\r\nMove in before the new school year.\r\nDeadline sale closes Tuesday 1 December at 4pm, unless sold prior. A December deadline means you can be settled and unpacked before Term 1.\r\n\r\nBuy with confidence\r\nPick up the buyer pack at the open home, or email us now: CCC, warranty details and property documents.\r\n\r\nOnly need four bedrooms? Its sister home, 57B, has 4 bedrooms, a ground-floor ensuite suite and the same certainty. It's open at the same times, so you can see both in one visit.",
